#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid ""
"It looks like this participant is already registered for this event. If you "
"want to change your registration, or you feel that you've received this "
"message in error, please contact the site administrator."
msgstr "Det ser ut til at denne deltakeren allerede er påmeldt dette arrangementet. Hvis du vil endre påmeldingen eller mener at du har mottatt denne meldingen ved en feil, kan du kontakte nettstedsadministratoren."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid "This contact has already been assigned to this event."
msgstr "Denne kontakten er allerede knyttet til dette arrangementet."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid ""
"It looks like you are already waitlisted for this event. If you want to "
"change your registration, or you feel that you've received this message in "
"error, please contact the site administrator."
msgstr "Det ser ut til at du allerede står på venteliste for dette arrangementet. Hvis du vil endre påmeldingen eller mener at du har mottatt denne meldingen ved en feil, kan du kontakte nettstedsadministratoren."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid ""
"It looks like you are already registered for this event. If you want to "
"change your registration, or you feel that you've received this message in "
"error, please contact the site administrator."
msgstr "Det ser ut til at du allerede er påmeldt dette arrangementet. Hvis du vil endre påmeldingen eller mener at du har mottatt denne meldingen ved en feil, kan du kontakte nettstedsadministratoren."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid "There is only enough space left on this event for %1 participant(s)."
msgstr "Det er bare %1 ledige plasser igjen på dette arrangementet."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php CRM/Event/Page/EventInfo.php
msgid ""
"The event you requested is currently unavailable (contact the site "
"administrator for assistance)."
msgstr "Arrangementet du ba om, er for øyeblikket utilgjengelig (kontakt nettstedsadministratoren for hjelp)."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid ""
"Online registration is not currently available for this event (contact the "
"site administrator for assistance)."
msgstr "Påmelding på nett er for øyeblikket ikke tilgjengelig for dette arrangementet (kontakt nettstedsadministratoren for hjelp)."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid "Event templates are not meant to be registered."
msgstr "Det skal ikke være mulig å melde seg på arrangementsmaler."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid "Registration for this event begins on %1"
msgstr "Påmeldingen til dette arrangementet åpner %1"

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid "Registration for this event ended on %1"
msgstr "Påmeldingen til dette arrangementet ble avsluttet %1"

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid ""
"Participant status has been updated to '%1'. An email has been sent to %2."
msgstr "Deltakerstatusen er oppdatert til '%1'. En e-post er sendt til %2."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid ""
"This event currently has the maximum number of participants registered (%1)."
" However, you can still override this limit and register additional "
"participants using this form."
msgstr "Dette arrangementet har nå maksimalt antall registrerte deltakere (%1). Du kan likevel overstyre grensen og registrere flere deltakere med dette skjemaet."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid ""
"There are %2 people currently on the waiting list for this event. You can <a"
" href='%1'>view waitlisted registrations here</a>, or you can continue and "
"register additional participants using this form."
msgstr "Det står for øyeblikket %2 personer på ventelisten for dette arrangementet. Du kan <a href='%1'>se påmeldingene på ventelisten her</a>, eller fortsette og registrere flere deltakere med dette skjemaet."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid "Registration selections changed for %1"
msgstr "Påmeldingsvalgene for %1 er endret"

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid ""
"This event registration can not be transferred or cancelled. Contact the "
"event organizer if you have questions."
msgstr "Denne påmeldingen kan ikke overføres eller kanselleres. Kontakt arrangøren hvis du har spørsmål."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid ""
"You cannot transfer or cancel your registration for %1 as you are not "
"currently registered for this event."
msgstr "Du kan ikke overføre eller kansellere påmeldingen din til %1 fordi du ikke er påmeldt dette arrangementet."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Participant.php
msgid ""
"Registration for this event cannot be cancelled or transferred %1 than %2 "
"hours %3 the event's start time. Contact the event organizer if you have "
"questions."
msgstr "Påmeldingen til dette arrangementet kan ikke kanselleres eller overføres %1 enn %2 timer %3 arrangementets starttidspunkt. Kontakt arrangøren hvis du har spørsmål."

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Query.php
msgid "Event Active On"
msgstr "Arrangement aktivt på"

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Query.php
msgid "Include Repeating Events"
msgstr "Ta med gjentakende arrangementer"

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Query.php
msgid "a Test"
msgstr "en test"

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Query.php
msgid "not a Test"
msgstr "ikke en test"

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Query.php
msgid "Participant is %1"
msgstr "Deltakeren er %1"

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Query.php schema/Event/Participant.entityType.php
msgid "Fee level"
msgstr "Prisnivå"

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Query.php
msgid "Include participants from all events in the %1 series"
msgstr "Ta med deltakere fra alle arrangementene i %1-serien"

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Query.php
msgid "Participant is a Test?"
msgstr "Er deltakeren en testdeltaker?"

#: CRM/Event/BAO/Query.php
msgid "Participant is Pay Later?"
msgstr "Har deltakeren valgt 'betal senere'?"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Delete.php CRM/Event/Page/ManageEvent.php
msgid "Delete Event"
msgstr "Slett arrangement"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Delete.php
msgid ""
"This event cannot be deleted because there are participant records linked to"
" it. If you want to delete this event, you must first find the participants "
"linked to this event and delete them. You can use use <a href='%1'> "
"CiviEvent >> Find Participants page </a>."
msgstr "Dette arrangementet kan ikke slettes fordi det er knyttet deltakerposter til det. Hvis du vil slette arrangementet, må du først finne og slette deltakerne som er knyttet til det. Du kan bruke siden <a href='%1'>CiviArrangement >> Finn deltakere</a>."

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Delete.php
msgid "'%1' has been deleted."
msgstr "'%1' er slettet."

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Delete.php
msgid "Template Deleted"
msgstr "Mal slettet"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Delete.php
msgid "Event Deleted"
msgstr "Arrangement slettet"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.php
msgid "This event is currently full."
msgstr "Dette arrangementet er for øyeblikket fulltegnet."

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.php
#: CRM/Event/Form/Registration/Register.php
msgid ""
"This event is currently full. However you can register now and get added to "
"a waiting list. You will be notified if spaces become available."
msgstr "Dette arrangementet er fulltegnet. Du kan likevel melde deg på ventelisten. Du får beskjed hvis det blir ledige plasser."

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.php
msgid ""
"If you find that you are creating multiple events with similar settings, you"
" may want to use the <a href=\"%1\">Event Templates</a> feature to "
"streamline your workflow."
msgstr "Hvis du oppretter flere arrangementer med lignende innstillinger, kan du bruke funksjonen <a href=\"%1\">Arrangementsmaler</a> for å forenkle arbeidsflyten."

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.php
msgid "From Template"
msgstr "Fra mal"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.php
msgid "Complete Description"
msgstr "Fullstendig beskrivelse"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.php
msgid "Display the event in public listings"
msgstr "Vis arrangementet i offentlige oversikter"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.php
msgid "Social media sharing links"
msgstr "Lenker for deling i sosiale medier"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.php
msgid "Map to the event location"
msgstr "Vis arrangementsstedet på kart"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.php
msgid "Calendar links"
msgstr "Kalenderlenker"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.php
msgid "Max Number of Participants"
msgstr "Maksimalt antall deltakere"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.php
msgid "Max participants should be a positive number"
msgstr "Maksimalt antall deltakere må være et positivt tall"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.php
msgid "Offer a Waitlist?"
msgstr "Tilby venteliste?"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/EventInfo.php
