msgid "Bottom Profile for Additional Participants"
msgstr "Nederste profil for flere deltakere"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php CRM/Event/Page/EventInfo.php
msgid "Register Now"
msgstr "Meld deg på nå"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Confirm Your Registration Information"
msgstr "Bekreft påmeldingsopplysningene dine"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Thank You for Registering"
msgstr "Takk for påmeldingen"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid ""
"Participation in this event requires approval. Submit your registration "
"request here. Once approved, you will receive an email with a link to a web "
"page where you can complete the registration process."
msgstr "Deltakelse på dette arrangementet krever godkjenning. Send inn påmeldingsforespørselen her. Når den er godkjent, får du en e-post med en lenke til en nettside der du kan fullføre påmeldingen."

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Registration Link Text"
msgstr "Lenketekst for påmelding"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
#: schema/Event/Event.entityType.php
msgid "Registration Start Date"
msgstr "Startdato for påmelding"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
#: schema/Event/Event.entityType.php
msgid "Registration End Date"
msgstr "Sluttdato for påmelding"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Register multiple participants?"
msgstr "Melde på flere deltakere?"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Maximum additional participants"
msgstr "Maksimalt antall ekstra deltakere"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Allow same email and multiple registrations?"
msgstr "Tillate flere påmeldinger med samme e-postadresse?"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "- Unsupervised rule -"
msgstr "- Ikke-overvåket regel -"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Duplicate matching rule"
msgstr "Regel for duplikatkontroll"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Require participant approval?"
msgstr "Krev godkjenning av deltakere?"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Approval message"
msgstr "Godkjenningsmelding"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Pending participant expiration (hours)"
msgstr "Utløp for ventende deltakere (timer)"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Please enter the number of hours (as an integer)."
msgstr "Angi antall timer (som et heltall)."

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Allow self-service cancellation or transfer?"
msgstr "Tillate selvbetjent kansellering eller overføring?"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Cancellation or transfer time limit (hours)"
msgstr "Tidsgrense for kansellering eller overføring (timer)"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Introductory Text"
msgstr "Introduksjonstekst"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
#: schema/Event/Event.entityType.php
msgid "Footer Text"
msgstr "Bunntekst"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Top Profile Fields for Additional Participants"
msgstr "Øverste profilfelt for flere deltakere"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Bottom Profile Fields for Additional Participants"
msgstr "Nederste profilfelt for flere deltakere"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Use a confirmation screen?"
msgstr "Bruke en bekreftelsesside?"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Send a confirmation email"
msgstr "Send en bekreftelse på e-post"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "CC Confirmation To"
msgstr "Send kopi av bekreftelsen til"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "BCC Confirmation To"
msgstr "Send blindkopi av bekreftelsen til"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
#: schema/Event/Event.entityType.php
msgid "Confirm From Name"
msgstr "Avsendernavn for bekreftelse"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
#: schema/Event/Event.entityType.php
msgid "Confirm From Email"
msgstr "Avsenderadresse for bekreftelse"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Please enter Registration Link Text"
msgstr "Skriv inn lenketeksten for påmelding"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Please enter a Title for the registration Confirmation Page"
msgstr "Angi en tittel for bekreftelsessiden for påmelding"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Please enter a Title for the registration Thank-you Page"
msgstr "Angi en tittel for takkesiden etter påmelding"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Please enter Confirmation Email FROM Name."
msgstr "Angi avsendernavnet for bekreftelses-e-posten."

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Please enter Confirmation Email FROM Email Address."
msgstr "Angi avsenderadressen for bekreftelses-e-posten."

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid ""
"Please add a profile with an email address if 'Send Confirmation Email?' is "
"selected"
msgstr "Legg til en profil med et e-postadressefelt hvis 'Send bekreftelse på e-post?' er valgt"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid ""
"Allow multiple registrations from the same email address requires a profile "
"of type 'Individual'"
msgstr "For å tillate flere påmeldinger fra samme e-postadresse kreves en profil av typen 'Individ'."

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid ""
"Please include a Profile for online registration that contains an Email "
"Address field and / or First Name + Last Name fields."
msgstr "Inkluder en profil for påmelding på nett som inneholder et felt for e-postadresse og/eller felt for fornavn og etternavn."

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid ""
"Please include a Profile for online registration of additional participants "
"that contains an Email Address field and / or First Name + Last Name fields."
msgstr "Inkluder en profil for påmelding på nett av flere deltakere som inneholder et felt for e-postadresse og/eller felt for fornavn og etternavn."

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid "Profile for Additional Participants"
msgstr "Profil for flere deltakere"

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid ""
"The selected profiles do not contain the fields necessary to match "
"registrations with existing contacts.  This means all anonymous "
"registrations will result in a new contact."
msgstr "De valgte profilene inneholder ikke feltene som trengs for å koble påmeldinger til eksisterende kontakter. Det betyr at alle anonyme påmeldinger oppretter en ny kontakt."

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid ""
"The selected profiles can collect enough information to match registrations "
"with existing contacts, but not all of the relevant fields are required.  "
"Anonymous registrations may result in duplicate contacts."
msgstr "De valgte profilene kan samle inn nok opplysninger til å koble påmeldinger til eksisterende kontakter, men ikke alle relevante felt er obligatoriske. Anonyme påmeldinger kan føre til duplikate kontakter."

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid ""
"The selected profiles do not contain the fields necessary to match "
"additional participants with existing contacts.  This means all additional "
"participants will result in a new contact."
msgstr "De valgte profilene inneholder ikke feltene som trengs for å koble flere deltakere til eksisterende kontakter. Det betyr at hver ekstra deltaker opprettes som en ny kontakt."

#: CRM/Event/Form/ManageEvent/Registration.php
msgid ""
"The selected profiles can collect enough information to match additional "
"participants with existing contacts, but not all of the relevant fields are "
